      "headline": "A letter in a hand you taught",
      "body": "A kestrel drops a letter on the ledge. {agent.name} writes from {court.name}'s throne that the priests have begun asking where the new {agent.noun} learned {agent.poss} craft, and that two of them have gone to the archive. {agent.subj} asks whether you would like the priests to find something, or nothing.",
      "because": "You released {agent.name} {a.years_ago:year} ago, schooled in intrigue and touched by your magic; a devout court notices."
    },
