      "headline": "A door in the temple of {temple.name}",
      "body": "The cult of {cult.name} has built a door in the temple at {temple.name} that opens onto nowhere yet. The priests say it opens for you. The neighbours say it opens for something else, and have sent soldiers to find out. Within two wakings it will open one way or the other, whether you are there or not.",
      "because": "Faith, magic and time have met in one court; a door is the shape they take.",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "zealot",
          "if": "bound(zealot)",
          "body": "The cult of {cult.name} has built a door at {temple.name} that opens onto nowhere yet. {zealot.name}'s soldiers are already in the valley below it with torches. Within two wakings it opens one way or the other, whether you are there or not."
        }
      ]
